    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(b) Slide the moulding out."
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "text": "Do not bend the moulding."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "6. REMOVE LOWER MOULDING"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Remove the two screws and the moulding."
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 2,
      "description": "Hand using knife to remove clip from vehicle body",
      "labels": [
        "Knife"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 22,
        "left": 4,
        "width": 36,
        "height": 16
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "REPLACEMENT OF FASTENER AND CLIP"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "If any fastener or clip is damaged, replace it."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "1. REMOVE DAMAGED CLIP"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "2. CUT OLD ADHESIVE OFF AROUND CLIP INSTALLATION AREA"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(a) Grind a notch into the clip so it latches onto the glass edge."
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 3,
      "description": "Two diagrams showing correct and wrong clip installation with clearance indicators",
      "labels": [
        "Correct",
        "Wrong",
        "Clearance"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 38,
        "left": 4,
        "width": 36,
        "height": 22
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(b) Temporarily install the clip and confirm that the clip tip is not sunk below the surface."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(c) If the tip of the clip is sunk below the surface, replace it."
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 4,
      "description": "Hand installing fastener into moulding",
      "labels": [],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 60,
        "left": 4,
        "width": 36,
        "height": 16
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "3. REMOVE ANY DAMAGED FASTENER"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "4. CUT OLD ADHESIVE OFF AROUND FASTENER INSTALLATION AREA"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "5. INSTALL FASTENER"
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 5,
      "description": "Lower moulding assembly with clips shown separately below",
      "labels": [],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 76,
        "left": 4,
        "width": 36,
        "height": 22
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "INSTALLATION OF OUTSIDE MOULDING"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(See page BO-12)"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "1. INSTALL LOWER MOULDING"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "2. INSTALL NEW CLIP INTO MOULDING"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Install the moulding to the body so that the clips and fasteners are not in a position where they will contact each other."
    }
  ]
